hiji-049","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p008","text":"高祖崩，諸御幸姬戚夫人之屬，呂太后怒，皆幽之，不得出宮。而薄姬以希見故，得出，從子之代，為代王太后。太后弟薄昭從如代。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m008-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003079","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m008-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"戚夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003051","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m008-0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"呂太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003050","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m008-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"薄姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003056","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m008-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003056","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m008-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003056","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m008-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"薄昭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003089","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-049","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p009","text":"代王立十七年，高后崩。大臣議立後，疾外家呂氏彊，皆稱薄氏仁善，故迎代王，立為孝文皇帝，而太后改號曰皇太后，弟薄昭封為軹侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m009-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"代王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003055","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m009-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"高后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003050","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m009-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"代王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003055","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m009-0038","start":38,"end":42,"surface":"孝文皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003055","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m009-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003056","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m009-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"太后","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或待核稱謂；不由熟悉生平補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m009-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"薄昭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003089","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-049","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p011","text":"薄太后後文帝二年，以孝景帝前二年崩，葬南陵。以呂后會葬長陵，故特自起陵，近孝文皇帝霸陵。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m011-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"薄太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003056","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m011-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003055","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m011-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"孝景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003061","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m011-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"呂后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003050","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m011-0037","start":37,"end":41,"surface":"孝文皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003055","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-049","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p012","text":"竇太后，趙之清河觀津人也。呂太后時，竇姬以良家子入宮侍太后。太后出宮人以賜諸王，各五人，竇姬與在行中。竇姬家在清河，欲如趙近家，請其主遣宦者吏：「必置我籍趙之伍中。」宦者忘之，誤置其籍代伍中。籍奏，詔可，當行。竇姬涕泣，怨其宦者，不欲往，相彊，乃肯行。至代，代王獨幸竇姬，生女嫖，後生兩男。而代王王后生四男。先代王未入立為帝而王后卒。及代王立為帝，而王后所生四男更病死。孝文帝立數月，公卿請立太子，而竇姬長男最長，立為太子。立竇姬為皇后，女嫖為長公主。其明年，立少子武為代王，已而又徙梁，是為梁孝王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"竇太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003062","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"呂太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003050","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"竇姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003062","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"竇姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003062","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"竇姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003062","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"竇姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003062","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0129","start":129,"end":131,"surface":"代王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或待核稱謂；不由熟悉生平補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0133","start":133,"end":135,"surface":"竇姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003062","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0138","start":138,"end":139,"surface":"嫖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003090","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"兩男","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或待核稱謂；不由熟悉生平補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0146","start":146,"end":150,"surface":"代王王后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003064","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"四男","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或待核稱謂；不由熟悉生平補姓名。"