"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0246","start":246,"end":249,"surface":"梁孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003063","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-049","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p044","text":"上居甘泉宮，召畫工圖畫周公負成王也。於是左右群臣知武帝意欲立少子也。後數日，帝譴責鉤弋夫人。夫人脫簪珥叩頭。帝曰：「引持去，送掖庭獄！」夫人還顧，帝曰：「趣行，女不得活！」夫人死雲陽宮。時暴風揚塵，百姓感傷。使者夜持棺往葬之，封識其處。其後帝閒居，問左右曰：「人言云何？」左右對曰：「人言且立其子，何去其母乎？」帝曰：「然。是非兒曹愚人所知也。往古國家所以亂也，由主少母壯也。女主獨居驕蹇，淫亂自恣，莫能禁也。女不聞呂后邪？」故諸為武帝生子者，無男女，其母無不譴死，豈可謂非賢聖哉！昭然遠見，為後世計慮，固非淺聞愚儒之所及也。謚為「武」，豈虛哉！","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m044-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"上","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m044-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"畫工","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m044-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"周公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003143","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m044-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003144","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m044-0020","start":20,"end":24,"surface":"左右群臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m044-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003145","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m044-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"少子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m044-0038","start":38,"end":39,"surface":"帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m0